    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa853c128498f8b125e243a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那你们也不需要做家事。\n现在不是可以请人来帮忙做家事吗？\n我会去打工来负担这笔费用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75c4cc00fd242f2f329c82a2c4ead90b1cbb8ab9d6c69aabb5db28a3a742d2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
